WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.161
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:05.431 --> 00:12.003
[Episode 12]

3
00:17.440 --> 00:19.679
- Hello, sir. - Hello, I'm Chen Wan.

4
00:19.679 --> 00:21.000
- Hello. - I'd like to see Ms. Ge.

5
00:21.000 --> 00:22.480
Is she available?

6
00:22.480 --> 00:23.839
Please have a seat for a moment.

7
00:23.839 --> 00:25.760
I'll call up to let her know.

8
00:25.760 --> 00:27.260
Okay.

9
00:49.079 --> 00:50.240
I'm very sorry.

10
00:50.240 --> 00:51.936
Ms. Ge is quite busy right now.

11
00:52.880 --> 00:53.920
It's fine.

12
00:53.920 --> 00:56.320
I didn't have an appointment, after all.

13
00:56.320 --> 00:59.799
Sir, Ms. Ge might not be free today.

14
00:59.799 --> 01:01.759
It's okay. I'll wait a bit longer.

15
01:01.759 --> 01:04.359
Please have a seat here.

16
01:10.760 --> 01:12.719
Hello, sir. This way, please.

17
01:12.719 --> 01:14.280
Okay.

18
01:15.200 --> 01:16.700
This way.

19
01:18.200 --> 01:19.700
Ms. Ge.

20
01:20.879 --> 01:21.920
What is it?

21
01:21.920 --> 01:24.359
What's worth Mr. Chen waiting so long?

22
01:24.359 --> 01:25.840
I have a few photos here.

23
01:25.840 --> 01:28.439
I'm not sure if you've seen them, Ms. Ge.

24
01:42.280 --> 01:44.560
You're quite interesting.

25
01:44.560 --> 01:47.573
Your mother's having an affair with my husband,

26
01:47.573 --> 01:49.959
and you personally bring me the photos?

27
01:49.959 --> 01:54.879
I came here not just to tell you about this.

28
01:54.879 --> 01:56.359
State your purpose.

29
01:56.359 --> 01:58.400
I'm here to talk to you

30
01:58.400 --> 02:01.000
about acquiring Rongxin's shares.

31
02:02.120 --> 02:03.760
What are you saying, Mr. Chen?

32
02:03.760 --> 02:05.879
I don't think I understand.

33
02:09.319 --> 02:12.479
This gemstone is called Pigeon Blood Red.

34
02:13.199 --> 02:17.039
Its first owner was a Swedish lady named Carmel.

35
02:17.039 --> 02:21.049
And she was once a tutor for the Ge family.

36
02:21.960 --> 02:23.639
But this Pigeon Blood ruby

37
02:23.639 --> 02:25.919
is now in your mother's possession.

38
02:25.919 --> 02:30.560
A Pigeon Blood ruby is worth a plot of land in Central.

39
02:30.560 --> 02:33.080
With such a large capital movement,

40
02:33.080 --> 02:37.280
I'm afraid Mr. Meng couldn't do it on his own.

41
02:38.160 --> 02:41.553
Song Qing Miao isn't very bright.

42
02:41.553 --> 02:45.120
But her son is both clever and filial.

43
02:45.120 --> 02:47.680
So, as an apology,

44
02:47.680 --> 02:49.560
I am willing to do what I can to help.

45
02:49.560 --> 02:50.846
I only hope that you will

46
02:50.846 --> 02:53.319
release a report in Taiji's name.

47
02:53.319 --> 02:54.400
The content should be

48
02:54.400 --> 02:56.960
that you invited my mother, Song Qing Miao,

49
02:56.960 --> 02:59.199
to Taiji's flagship store,

50
02:59.199 --> 03:01.439
with Mr. Meng accompanying her.

51
03:02.120 --> 03:03.240
That's it?

52
03:03.240 --> 03:04.520
That's all.

53
03:04.520 --> 03:07.680
My husband is a major shareholder of Rongxin.

54
03:07.680 --> 03:09.159
But you...

55
03:09.159 --> 03:12.319
You haven't even entered Rongxin's inner circle of power.

56
03:12.319 --> 03:13.800
Why should I believe you?

57
03:13.800 --> 03:16.599
Because I'm more useful than Meng Yuan Xiong.

58
03:16.599 --> 03:20.840
I'm willing to transfer a 2-percent stake in Rongxin Group to you first.

59
03:20.840 --> 03:22.800
You can decide then

60
03:22.800 --> 03:24.599
if you want to work with me.

61
03:24.599 --> 03:27.119
It won't be too late.

62
03:27.119 --> 03:28.402
Ms. Ge.

63
03:29.333 --> 03:31.155
Mr. Chen, please enjoy.

64
03:33.319 --> 03:34.599
You didn't come here

65
03:34.599 --> 03:37.399
just to save your mother, did you?

66
03:37.399 --> 03:40.520
You want to get someone else to do your dirty work.

67
03:40.520 --> 03:42.520
Kill two birds with one stone.

68
03:42.520 --> 03:44.439
Rongxin has been around for years.

69
03:44.439 --> 03:46.919
It's riddled with deep-seated problems.

70
03:46.919 --> 03:51.040
It's in desperate need of a major overhaul.

71
03:51.040 --> 03:54.600
I'm just an honest business person.

72
03:54.600 --> 03:57.919
I don't want to do anything illegal.

73
03:59.066 --> 04:01.665
I won't do anything illegal either.

74
04:06.479 --> 04:08.719
I'll give you a week.

75
04:08.719 --> 04:14.159
Let's see if you have what it takes to pull it off.

76
04:14.159 --> 04:15.999
Okay.

77
04:15.999 --> 04:18.040
Some people are never satisfied.

78
04:18.040 --> 04:21.321
They'll pay the price sooner or later.

79
04:25.480 --> 04:26.920
I heard that Lychee Bay

80
04:26.920 --> 04:28.319
and the offshore oil channel project

81
04:28.319 --> 04:31.560
are set to go public at the end of the year.

82
04:31.560 --> 04:32.800
Wan.

83
04:32.800 --> 04:34.560
You'll be on the roadshow team too, right?

84
04:34.560 --> 04:36.359
Liao Quan.

85
04:36.359 --> 04:38.839
What exactly do you want from me?

86
04:38.839 --> 04:41.839
Do you want to lose another finger?

87
04:41.839 --> 04:43.679
Your temper hasn't changed at all.

88
04:43.679 --> 04:45.279
It's just like when you were a kid.

89
04:45.279 --> 04:46.600
Give me a chance.

90
04:46.600 --> 04:49.463
Some things... must be said clearly, right?

91
04:50.319 --> 04:52.519
I've always been ruthless to those who get in my way.

92
04:52.519 --> 04:54.879
That hasn't changed.

93
04:56.160 --> 04:57.399
When I went crazy as a kid,

94
04:57.399 --> 05:00.400
I was just locked up in Mount Xiaolan for a few years.

95
05:00.400 --> 05:03.441
But if I go crazy now that I'm grown...

96
05:07.800 --> 05:11.560
Wan, when you look at Zhao Sheng Ge,

97
05:11.560 --> 05:13.835
is it always with that look in your eyes?

98
05:14.639 --> 05:17.360
How many times has he slept with you?

99
05:17.360 --> 05:21.040
How many times did it take to get this project?

100
05:23.120 --> 05:28.079
In this regard, you're even better than your mother.

101
05:28.079 --> 05:29.639
Watch your mouth.

102
05:29.639 --> 05:32.720
I have ten thousand ways to make you disappear.

103
05:32.720 --> 05:33.720
I'm sure you do.

104
05:33.720 --> 05:36.199
You're so precious.

105
05:36.199 --> 05:38.679
No one else can touch you, only he can.

106
05:38.679 --> 05:40.399
Does Zhao Sheng Ge know

107
05:40.399 --> 05:41.839
that you were once locked up in Mount Xiaolan?

108
05:41.839 --> 05:44.319
That shameful place?

109
05:44.319 --> 05:45.600
I'm just saying, what if...

110
05:45.600 --> 05:49.240
What if your mother's scandal and the public outcry

111
05:49.240 --> 05:51.279
affect Lychee Bay

112
05:51.279 --> 05:54.079
and the offshore oil project's listing and roadshow?

113
05:54.079 --> 05:57.839
Tell me, will Zhao Sheng Ge still want you?

114
05:57.839 --> 06:01.581
And how will he explain it to his shareholders?

115
06:04.160 --> 06:05.639
Meng Yuan Xiong gave your mother

116
06:05.639 --> 06:07.759
a vintage Pigeon Blood ruby.

117
06:07.759 --> 06:09.319
Where did he get that kind of money?

118
06:09.319 --> 06:11.079
If his wife, Ge Xi, looks into it,

119
06:11.079 --> 06:12.360
how will you get the authorities

120
06:12.360 --> 06:15.920
and investors to believe your financial statements are clean?

121
06:15.920 --> 06:17.600
Is this all you've got?

122
06:17.600 --> 06:19.639
This is enough.

123
06:19.639 --> 06:21.480
As long as it stirs up public opinion.

124
06:21.480 --> 06:22.639
With your mother's reputation,

125
06:22.639 --> 06:24.959
you know that once these photos get out,

126
06:24.959 --> 06:26.360
your father will deal with her.

127
06:26.360 --> 06:27.439
And Meng Yuan Xiong's wife

128
06:27.439 --> 06:29.720
is the eldest daughter of Taiji Group.

129
06:29.720 --> 06:33.600
You know Ge Xi's methods better than I do.

130
06:33.600 --> 06:35.240
Zhao Sheng Ge's project

131
06:35.240 --> 06:39.240
will lose all credibility due to the scandal.

132
06:39.240 --> 06:41.040
Three birds with one stone.

133
06:41.040 --> 06:42.480
This is more than enough.

134
06:42.480 --> 06:46.160
Is this your idea, or the Chen family's?

135
06:49.720 --> 06:51.759
Exactly.

136
06:51.759 --> 06:52.880
Where's your father?

137
06:52.880 --> 06:53.919
He wants to see you, too.

138
06:53.919 --> 06:55.920
But I'm one step ahead of him.

139
06:55.920 --> 06:59.482
Because I have a few more chips than he does.

140
07:00.480 --> 07:01.879
What do you want?

141
07:01.879 --> 07:03.680
I want to supply your building materials.

142
07:03.680 --> 07:05.920
Minglong is the biggest ship in Hai City.

143
07:05.920 --> 07:08.519
I have to get a piece of the action, don't you think?

144
07:08.519 --> 07:10.480
You're dreaming.

145
07:10.480 --> 07:13.160
Wan, stop pretending with me.

146
07:13.160 --> 07:15.040
I want to handle your transit transport.

147
07:15.040 --> 07:18.319
You have that much authority.

148
07:18.319 --> 07:21.639
Or is your pillow talk not effective enough?

149
07:23.560 --> 07:25.680
This tea is not bad.

150
07:27.560 --> 07:30.420
You know the current state of Rongxin.

151
07:30.420 --> 07:34.247
Even if I didn't come to you today, your father would have.

152
07:34.247 --> 07:36.567
And your father wouldn't give you anything.

153
07:36.567 --> 07:37.953
Why not cooperate with me?

154
07:37.953 --> 07:38.992
Don't you agree?

155
07:38.992 --> 07:40.017
Cooperate with you?

156
07:40.017 --> 07:41.252
What do I get out of it?

157
07:41.252 --> 07:42.289
I can guarantee you this.

158
07:42.289 --> 07:43.522
Once we win the bid,

159
07:43.522 --> 07:45.770
the photos will be destroyed immediately.

160
07:45.770 --> 07:47.120
No backups left.

161
07:47.120 --> 07:49.345
And if you want to suppress this completely,

162
07:49.345 --> 07:52.012
it's best to pull me onto Zhao Sheng Ge's ship.

163
07:52.012 --> 07:54.020
Then our interests will be aligned.

164
07:54.020 --> 07:57.084
We'll sink or swim together.

165
07:57.751 --> 08:00.559
I wouldn't smash my own rice bowl, would I?

166
08:00.559 --> 08:04.155
What you have here isn't worth that much.

167
08:04.155 --> 08:07.213
Besides that, I want six percent of Rongxin's retail shares.

168
08:07.213 --> 08:09.438
No options.

169
08:09.438 --> 08:10.840
Six percent?

170
08:10.840 --> 08:12.305
What do you want the shares for?

171
08:12.305 --> 08:15.040
You want a favor without offering benefits?

172
08:15.040 --> 08:17.308
What kind of daydream is that?

173
08:17.308 --> 08:18.640
The photos and the shares.

174
08:18.640 --> 08:19.991
I want them all.

175
08:19.991 --> 08:21.329
Otherwise, no deal.

176
08:21.329 --> 08:22.572
Liao Quan.

177
08:22.572 --> 08:24.919
Know your own weight.

178
08:24.919 --> 08:27.279
Do you really think that after releasing those things,

179
08:27.279 --> 08:29.680
you'll be able to stay out of it?

180
08:29.680 --> 08:31.439
You've messed with Zhao Sheng Ge's project.

181
08:31.439 --> 08:34.879
Zhao Sheng Ge can crush you with a snap of his fingers.

182
08:34.879 --> 08:36.440
I don't have that many shares.

183
08:36.440 --> 08:38.064
I can't collect that many public shares.

184
08:38.064 --> 08:39.868
Then there's nothing to talk about.

185
08:40.666 --> 08:43.234
Four percent. Five percent.

186
08:44.159 --> 08:46.639
Get them first, then we'll talk.

187
08:46.639 --> 08:49.759
Let's not bicker over a single percentage point.

188
08:49.759 --> 08:50.759
Think of these funds

189
08:50.759 --> 08:54.200
as start-up capital to restart the Mount Xiaolan project.

190
08:55.639 --> 08:59.279
Liao Quan, if you try any more tricks,

191
08:59.279 --> 09:00.919
the bullet from this gun

192
09:00.919 --> 09:03.159
will be just like those scissors from 19 years ago.

193
09:03.159 --> 09:05.799
It'll blow your head off.

194
09:05.799 --> 09:07.280
I know, I know.

195
09:07.280 --> 09:08.837
The shares are negotiable.

196
09:08.837 --> 09:10.527
They're negotiable.

197
09:26.519 --> 09:28.360
Jin.

198
09:28.360 --> 09:31.519
Speak. Who are we taking down this time?

199
09:31.519 --> 09:33.118
I want to withdraw from the partnership.

200
09:34.840 --> 09:36.919
Withdraw?

201
09:36.919 --> 09:39.120
It's not a big deal.

202
09:39.120 --> 09:41.679
I'll still follow up on R&amp;D.

203
09:41.679 --> 09:43.319
But for the patents and proposals,

204
09:43.319 --> 09:46.080
my name shouldn't appear from now on.

205
09:46.080 --> 09:49.759
Drastic measures are the best way to handle this.

206
09:51.279 --> 09:54.360
Zhao Sheng Ge is all-powerful in Hai City.

207
09:54.360 --> 09:56.080
Dealing with these people is nothing...

208
09:56.080 --> 09:57.320
Jin.

209
09:57.320 --> 10:00.280
These two projects involve top-level government documents.

210
10:00.280 --> 10:01.759
They involve state assets and livelihoods.

211
10:01.759 --> 10:02.759
I know.

212
10:02.759 --> 10:03.920
Money is a small matter.

213
10:03.920 --> 10:06.779
Public trust and social image are what's important.

214
10:06.779 --> 10:09.499
Besides, it's not just about this time.

215
10:10.639 --> 10:12.519
This matter started because of me.

216
10:12.519 --> 10:15.075
It's only right that I end it.

217
10:16.200 --> 10:18.240
In these troubled times, I want to be cautious.

218
10:18.240 --> 10:20.640
I don't want any more mistakes.

219
10:20.640 --> 10:24.059
You built Kexiang brick by brick.

220
10:24.059 --> 10:27.138
You know best the effort you've put in.

221
10:27.138 --> 10:29.099
I'm just stepping back temporarily.

222
10:29.099 --> 10:30.819
It's not like I'm quitting for good.

223
10:30.819 --> 10:32.219
Once I've handled all this,

224
10:32.219 --> 10:33.316
I'll come back with a clean slate.

225
10:33.316 --> 10:35.030
Isn't that better?

226
10:36.919 --> 10:38.120
Fine.

227
10:38.120 --> 10:39.279
Your position at Kexiang...

228
10:39.279 --> 10:40.879
I'll always keep it open for you.

229
10:40.879 --> 10:42.220
As for the dividends,

230
10:42.220 --> 10:43.679
even if they can't be on the books,

231
10:43.679 --> 10:47.279
you'll still get every cent you're owed.

232
10:47.279 --> 10:48.559
Don't you dare cook the books.

233
10:48.559 --> 10:50.360
We must follow the law.

234
10:50.360 --> 10:52.515
Thank you, Jin.

235
11:02.064 --> 11:05.825
[Zhao Sheng Ge unsent a message]

236
11:13.515 --> 11:15.124
[What did you send?]

237
11:16.488 --> 11:18.321
[It's nothing]

238
11:18.321 --> 11:21.161
[Still at work?]

239
11:28.042 --> 11:29.053
[In a meeting? Should I go pick you up?]

240
11:29.053 --> 11:30.596
[It's fine]

241
11:35.363 --> 11:40.341
[Zhao Sheng Ge]

242
11:44.787 --> 11:46.169
[It'll end pretty late]

243
11:47.994 --> 11:49.175
[Roger]

244
11:49.175 --> 11:50.934
[All right]

245
12:18.519 --> 12:20.047
The meeting's over?

246
12:21.919 --> 12:23.639
I'll drive you back.

247
12:23.639 --> 12:25.360
Have you been waiting long?

248
12:26.360 --> 12:27.960
You look a bit tired.

249
12:27.960 --> 12:31.467
Zhao Sheng Ge, are you this nice to all your suitors?

250
12:32.519 --> 12:34.879
It seems this suitor doesn't know how to act.

251
12:34.879 --> 12:37.440
Fine. You drive, then.

252
12:51.200 --> 12:53.720
The latest mapping charts are in the file bag in the back.

253
12:53.720 --> 12:56.000
Do you want to see them?

254
12:56.000 --> 12:57.500
Sure.

255
13:06.312 --> 13:10.337
The data here is much more precise than last time.

256
13:10.337 --> 13:13.485
Yes. Fang Jian led a team to re-survey it.

257
13:15.314 --> 13:19.138
You named this the Full Moon Channel?

258
13:19.138 --> 13:20.564
Yes.

259
13:20.564 --> 13:23.049
Isn't that what we agreed on?

260
13:31.740 --> 13:32.885
Why are we at my house?

261
13:32.885 --> 13:34.229
I'll take the car.

262
13:34.229 --> 13:36.163
Go home and get some sleep.

263
13:45.195 --> 13:47.078
What's wrong?

264
13:47.078 --> 13:51.064
Zhao Sheng Ge, can I have a kiss today?

265
13:51.064 --> 13:52.649
We didn't kiss yesterday.

266
13:52.649 --> 13:55.041
And we haven't kissed today.

267
13:56.780 --> 13:59.021
Have you won me over yet?

268
14:00.274 --> 14:02.058
We didn't kiss yesterday...

269
14:02.058 --> 14:04.587
because you didn't show up.

270
14:05.680 --> 14:07.465
What?

271
14:07.465 --> 14:09.266
You want it that badly?

272
14:11.847 --> 14:13.447
Come here.

273
14:27.240 --> 14:28.985
Chen Wan.

274
14:28.985 --> 14:31.331
Are you hiding something from me?

275
14:31.331 --> 14:33.516
I'm not.

276
14:33.516 --> 14:35.317
Chen Wan.

277
14:36.574 --> 14:39.214
Your heartbeat is giving you away.

278
14:40.534 --> 14:42.758
Let's call it a day.

279
14:42.758 --> 14:44.718
We'll try again tomorrow.

280
14:51.533 --> 14:53.119
Okay then.

281
14:53.119 --> 14:54.583
I'll get going then.

282
14:54.583 --> 14:57.328
Fang Jian is the one taking the exam tomorrow.

283
14:57.328 --> 15:00.921
Tell me what you're hiding from me tomorrow.

284
15:03.287 --> 15:05.407
I'll head back first.

285
15:16.283 --> 15:17.308
Zhao Sheng Ge.

286
15:17.308 --> 15:18.582
Goodbye.

287
16:07.008 --> 16:08.647
Wan.

288
16:08.647 --> 16:10.527
Hey, Xuan.

289
16:11.287 --> 16:12.882
I need you to do me a favor.

290
16:14.147 --> 16:15.667
The shares of the Chen family.

291
16:15.667 --> 16:18.028
Chen Wan, do you still want to pursue Zhao Sheng Ge?

292
16:18.028 --> 16:19.627
Yes.

293
16:19.627 --> 16:21.787
I want to pursue him with a clean slate.

294
16:21.787 --> 16:22.948
Then don't go after him.

295
16:22.948 --> 16:25.975
He'll destroy you if you do this.

296
16:26.868 --> 16:28.548
I'll explain everything to him.

297
16:28.548 --> 16:30.071
But you...

298
16:48.867 --> 16:50.667
Hey, are you stupid?

299
16:50.667 --> 16:52.348
Do you know what you're doing?

300
16:52.348 --> 16:53.627
Do you think you're Superman?

301
16:53.627 --> 16:55.188
Why are you shouldering everything?

302
16:55.188 --> 16:57.108
Who is Zhao Sheng Ge to you?

303
16:57.108 --> 16:59.667
Does he even know how much you've done for him?

304
16:59.667 --> 17:01.867
Forget it. I know you won't listen to anything I say.

305
17:01.867 --> 17:03.867
Think it through yourself.

306
17:16.747 --> 17:17.827
Mr. Chen.

307
17:17.827 --> 17:19.388
Are you still coming over today?

308
17:19.388 --> 17:21.066
I'm on my way now.

309
17:35.267 --> 17:37.708
I'm not feeling well.

310
17:37.708 --> 17:39.747
I feel nauseous.

311
17:39.747 --> 17:41.668
And my head hurts.

312
17:43.747 --> 17:46.068
But I have to endure it.

313
17:46.068 --> 17:48.988
I can't let anyone see it.

314
17:48.988 --> 17:51.668
Can't let anyone see what?

315
17:52.948 --> 17:54.988
The past.

316
17:54.988 --> 17:57.148
You're protecting yourself.

317
17:57.148 --> 17:58.868
You're keeping it from him.

318
17:58.868 --> 18:00.428
The things you think...

319
18:00.428 --> 18:02.827
would make him leave you.

320
18:04.228 --> 18:07.868
But Mr. Chen, do you realize this habit of yours...

321
18:07.868 --> 18:10.827
prevents him from seeing the real you?

322
18:11.948 --> 18:14.428
The real me?

323
18:14.428 --> 18:18.188
Your body is telling you, "I'm hurt."

324
18:18.188 --> 18:20.668
"I need to be seen."

325
18:20.668 --> 18:24.787
But you're used to hiding everything and keeping it all inside.

326
18:24.787 --> 18:28.077
You've suppressed this signal for far too long.

327
18:29.428 --> 18:31.267
I'm afraid...

328
18:32.028 --> 18:35.524
if I don't suppress it, I'll...

329
18:35.524 --> 18:37.747
I'll fall apart.

330
18:39.027 --> 18:41.988
Mr. Chen, can you allow yourself

331
18:41.988 --> 18:43.468
to stop putting on a strong front

332
18:43.468 --> 18:45.538
when you're in front of him?

333
18:46.581 --> 18:49.068
The voice telling you to hang in there

334
18:49.068 --> 18:50.862
isn't the only voice you have.

335
18:51.788 --> 18:54.428
The nausea, the pain...

336
18:54.428 --> 18:59.520
They're all your body's way of telling you, "I'm hurt."

337
19:00.988 --> 19:05.479
I'm afraid... of losing him.

338
19:07.908 --> 19:09.747
It's okay.

339
19:09.747 --> 19:11.948
Give yourself some time.

340
19:17.388 --> 19:20.548
Thank you, Monica.

341
19:26.228 --> 19:29.388
That's all for now. Go ahead with it.

342
19:29.388 --> 19:30.888
By the way...

343
19:31.628 --> 19:32.668
Rongxin has had a few

344
19:32.668 --> 19:34.708
odd-lot stock transactions recently

345
19:34.708 --> 19:36.587
that look rather suspicious.

346
19:37.388 --> 19:38.628
Why do you care about a company

347
19:38.628 --> 19:40.827
as declining as Rongxin?

348
19:40.827 --> 19:42.268
Even Chen Wan might not want to bother.

349
19:42.268 --> 19:43.747
His mother is still with the Chen family.

350
19:43.747 --> 19:46.507
I just don't want anything unpleasant to happen

351
19:46.507 --> 19:48.067
that might affect Chen Wan.

352
19:48.067 --> 19:49.908
No more observing from the sidelines?

353
19:49.908 --> 19:51.960
Planning to step in yourself?

354
19:52.827 --> 19:54.668
I don't care about the Chen family's affairs.

355
19:54.668 --> 19:56.507
But the Ge family of Taiji and Xu Zhi Ying

356
19:56.507 --> 19:59.668
have always been ambitious about eroding and taking over Rongxin.

357
19:59.668 --> 20:01.468
Chen Bing Xin can fend for himself.

358
20:01.468 --> 20:03.027
I'm just afraid...

359
20:03.027 --> 20:06.388
Chen Wan will waste his efforts on his mother.

360
20:06.388 --> 20:08.401
So, you're worried about your mother-in-law.

361
20:09.468 --> 20:10.787
If you're not focused on the pursuit,

362
20:10.787 --> 20:12.868
you'll never win him over.

363
20:12.868 --> 20:14.267
I'm telling him in advance

364
20:14.267 --> 20:16.988
just so he can be prepared.

365
20:16.988 --> 20:20.188
After all, Kexiang is Chen Wan's life's work.

366
20:20.188 --> 20:23.628
I don't want the issues at Rongxin to affect Kexiang.

367
20:23.628 --> 20:25.188
Don't waste your breath.

368
20:25.188 --> 20:27.908
He's a silent partner in Kexiang.

369
20:27.908 --> 20:30.108
Even if there's a change, it won't be made public.

370
20:31.188 --> 20:33.347
Besides...

371
20:33.347 --> 20:35.347
Besides, isn't he all ears to you right now?

372
20:35.347 --> 20:37.708
Finding out anything should be a piece of cake.

373
20:37.708 --> 20:39.528
You don't know him.

374
20:43.107 --> 20:45.109
Anyway, from what I can see,

375
20:46.148 --> 20:48.347
it has nothing to do with him.

376
20:48.948 --> 20:52.948
I just hope he can tell me everything.

377
20:52.948 --> 20:55.668
Nothing is more important than that.

378
21:00.547 --> 21:02.188
Mr. Shen.

379
21:03.267 --> 21:04.307
Mr. Zhao.

380
21:04.307 --> 21:05.988
Currently, it seems Ms. Song's assets

381
21:05.988 --> 21:08.148
have almost no interaction with Mr. Chen's.

382
21:08.148 --> 21:11.708
Aside from some real estate and high-value insurance beneficiaries,

383
21:11.708 --> 21:13.708
Ms. Song's recent shareholding ratio

384
21:13.708 --> 21:14.908
hasn't changed much.

385
21:14.908 --> 21:17.547
This bottom-fishing likely has little to do with her.

386
21:17.547 --> 21:20.747
Then the artificial boom in Rongxin's stock price...

387
21:21.868 --> 21:24.587
Tracking the changes in her equity flow

388
21:24.587 --> 21:26.228
will still take some time.

389
21:26.228 --> 21:27.668
Rongxin's management is a mess.

390
21:27.668 --> 21:29.923
Their disclosures aren't transparent enough.

391
21:30.587 --> 21:32.347
Keep investigating.

392
21:32.347 --> 21:33.557
Yes, sir.

393
21:48.547 --> 21:50.628
I thought it was Qian Sheng.

394
21:50.628 --> 21:52.908
So, it's the "Double Flower Red Pole."

395
21:52.908 --> 21:54.668
Big Bro trusted you so much.

396
21:54.668 --> 21:56.588
Yet, you played dirty behind his back.

397
21:56.588 --> 21:58.908
How dare you show up at Baihe Hall?

398
22:01.507 --> 22:05.644
Baihe Hall isn't your place to call the shots.

399
22:07.628 --> 22:10.428
If not me, then who?

400
22:10.428 --> 22:15.500
Could it be that fence-sitter, Shao Yao Zong?

401
22:17.027 --> 22:18.708
We're brothers, after all.

402
22:18.708 --> 22:20.814
I'll give you a piece of friendly advice.

403
22:20.814 --> 22:23.228
Look at what happened to Luo Qian Sheng.

404
22:23.228 --> 22:25.599
Consider yourself warned.

405
22:26.708 --> 22:28.107
Mr. Li.

406
22:28.107 --> 22:31.107
Luo Qian Sheng wasn't smart.

407
22:31.107 --> 22:34.468
And I won't give that nephew of mine another chance.

408
22:38.227 --> 22:39.468
And you?

409
22:39.468 --> 22:42.107
It's time for you to leave.

410
22:42.107 --> 22:44.228
You're chattering on...

411
22:44.228 --> 22:46.047
and it's annoying.

412
23:03.027 --> 23:04.628
What a rare guest.

413
23:04.628 --> 23:05.668
Jia Ming.

414
23:05.668 --> 23:07.587
I heard you've found a powerful backer.

415
23:07.587 --> 23:09.617
Congratulations.

416
23:11.267 --> 23:12.628
If you find a way to make a fortune,

417
23:12.628 --> 23:14.027
remember to give me a hand.

418
23:14.027 --> 23:15.628
The feeling is mutual.

419
23:15.628 --> 23:17.787
A strategist always has many options.

420
23:17.787 --> 23:19.547
I wouldn't dare say I'm helping you.

421
23:19.547 --> 23:21.708
Why are you all here today?

422
23:21.708 --> 23:24.027
It's almost the 100th day since Big Bro's death.

423
23:24.027 --> 23:25.947
So, you still remember him.

424
23:26.787 --> 23:28.388
That's rich coming from you.

425
23:28.388 --> 23:31.587
You're the one who moved on before his body was even cold.

426
23:31.587 --> 23:33.228
Since you're so capable,

427
23:33.228 --> 23:35.027
why are you messing with me?

428
23:35.027 --> 23:37.107
Everyone must find their own way.

429
23:37.107 --> 23:38.174
Regarding Big Bro's death,

430
23:38.174 --> 23:40.347
don't you know the truth?

431
23:40.347 --> 23:41.347
If I hadn't left,

432
23:41.347 --> 23:44.082
I would've ended up just like him.

433
23:46.628 --> 23:49.067
Take care of yourself.

434
23:54.677 --> 23:55.868
[Notice from Hai City's Bureau of Investigation]

435
23:55.868 --> 23:57.027
Mr. Chen Wan.

436
23:57.027 --> 23:58.107
Our investigation shows

437
23:58.107 --> 23:59.587
that during the Rongxin stock trades,

438
23:59.587 --> 24:01.228
you engaged in market manipulation.

439
24:01.228 --> 24:04.628
Please come with us for further questioning.

440
24:05.747 --> 24:07.347
All right.

441
24:07.347 --> 24:08.957
Officers.

442
24:09.908 --> 24:13.148
I'd like to take a few minutes of Mr. Chen's time.

443
24:13.148 --> 24:14.648
All right.

444
24:21.107 --> 24:23.482
Do you have anything to say to me?

445
24:25.188 --> 24:27.228
You've already seen everything.

446
24:27.228 --> 24:28.868
Chen Wan.

447
24:29.628 --> 24:32.388
I'm asking if you have anything to say to me.

448
24:35.347 --> 24:37.347
This is my own business.

449
24:37.347 --> 24:40.220
I will take full responsibility.

450
24:40.220 --> 24:42.270
Your own business?

451
24:44.094 --> 24:45.608
Chen Wan.

452
24:46.668 --> 24:48.868
Who do you take me for?

453
24:48.868 --> 24:51.027
A temporary hookup?

454
24:51.027 --> 24:53.082
Or just the boss of Party A?

455
24:54.428 --> 24:56.307
Zhao Sheng Ge.

456
24:56.307 --> 24:57.347
Please don't be like this.

457
24:57.347 --> 25:00.575
Do you think I'll give you up because of these things?

458
25:05.307 --> 25:08.560
Do you think my feelings for you are that cheap?

459
25:12.908 --> 25:14.517
Chen Wan.

460
25:15.388 --> 25:17.561
I'm very disappointed in you.

461
25:41.908 --> 25:44.167
Who do you take me for?

462
25:44.167 --> 25:46.307
A temporary hookup?

463
25:46.307 --> 25:48.080
Or just the boss of Party A?

464
25:52.428 --> 25:55.787
Do you think I'll give you up because of these things?

465
26:00.628 --> 26:04.188
Do you think my feelings for you are that cheap?

466
26:08.148 --> 26:10.468
Chen Wan.

467
26:10.468 --> 26:12.948
I'm very disappointed in you.

468
26:32.828 --> 26:35.749
Grab his hands! Don't let him move!

469
26:36.547 --> 26:39.082
Grab his hands! Don't let him move!

470
26:40.468 --> 26:43.075
Don't even think about getting out of here in this life!

471
26:44.868 --> 26:46.748
Don't even think about getting out of here in this life!

472
26:46.748 --> 26:51.148
Don't even think about getting out of here in this life!

473
26:51.148 --> 26:54.495
Don't even think about getting out of here in this life!

474
27:10.067 --> 27:11.708
Mr. Zhao.

475
27:11.708 --> 27:14.250
Why did you call me here so urgently?

476
27:15.148 --> 27:16.635
Xuan.

477
27:17.988 --> 27:20.029
I know everything now.

478
27:21.600 --> 27:24.068
[Mount Xiaolan Psychiatric Hospital]

479
27:24.068 --> 27:27.568
But I want to hear it from you in person one more time.

480
27:30.148 --> 27:31.787
Of course.

481
27:31.787 --> 27:34.563
This isn't an order or a threat.

482
27:35.708 --> 27:38.061
It's a request.

483
27:42.507 --> 27:44.075
Sit.

484
27:57.388 --> 28:01.307
I don't know that much about Mount Xiaolan.

485
28:01.307 --> 28:03.587
He did tell me that...

486
28:04.868 --> 28:08.067
From the first time he saw you there until now,

487
28:08.067 --> 28:11.747
it's been... 16 years.

488
28:17.787 --> 28:19.628
Do you remember?

489
28:19.628 --> 28:22.428
After graduation, you flew to California early.

490
28:22.428 --> 28:25.228
Tan You Ming brought a group of friends to see you off.

491
28:25.228 --> 28:27.908
At the customs gate, I asked if you could...

492
28:27.908 --> 28:30.708
wait one more minute.

493
28:30.708 --> 28:32.431
I don't remember.

494
28:33.267 --> 28:35.908
It was because Chen Wan was on his way.

495
28:35.908 --> 28:38.501
He... He escaped.

496
28:39.547 --> 28:41.908
Chen Bing Xin had locked him in the basement.

497
28:41.908 --> 28:46.027
Because Song Qing Miao had gambled away a fortune.

498
28:46.027 --> 28:48.108
Chen Bing Xin was furious.

499
28:48.108 --> 28:50.544
He beat both of them severely.

500
28:52.708 --> 28:55.529
Chen Wan had also applied to your university.

501
28:56.787 --> 28:59.628
He found out you were flying early.

502
28:59.628 --> 29:02.948
He said he wanted to see you one last time.

503
29:02.948 --> 29:08.738
Of course, he only watched you from afar on the jet bridge.

504
29:09.988 --> 29:12.154
He would never have bothered you.

505
29:13.868 --> 29:15.468
Do you remember?

506
29:15.468 --> 29:19.827
One semester, we signed up for rugby class.

507
29:19.827 --> 29:21.787
I always said I brought extra wristbands.

508
29:21.787 --> 29:24.388
Actually, Chen Wan was the one who prepared them.

509
29:24.388 --> 29:26.587
The same goes for many of the drinks.

510
29:27.507 --> 29:29.959
You... You definitely don't remember.

511
29:31.868 --> 29:32.948
Chen Wan...

512
29:32.948 --> 29:35.347
He watched every one of your speeches and matches.

513
29:35.347 --> 29:40.181
Later, when I went away on an exchange program,

514
29:40.181 --> 29:42.468
he never watched them again.

515
29:42.468 --> 29:45.267
And, your award-winning model

516
29:45.267 --> 29:47.148
exhibited in the Run Run Shaw Building.

517
29:47.148 --> 29:49.788
There were many typhoons that semester.

518
29:49.788 --> 29:52.547
But after every typhoon holiday,

519
29:52.547 --> 29:54.587
he would take my card,

520
29:54.587 --> 29:56.188
sneak inside,

521
29:56.188 --> 29:59.747
and wipe your model clean, bit by bit.

522
29:59.747 --> 30:01.627
That robot...

523
30:06.428 --> 30:09.139
So, none of it was a coincidence.

524
30:10.708 --> 30:12.208
What was the time?

525
30:13.468 --> 30:14.787
One minute and five seconds.

526
30:14.787 --> 30:16.107
One minute and five seconds!

527
30:16.107 --> 30:19.440
He set a new record!

528
30:19.440 --> 30:21.988
I can't hold him back.

529
30:21.988 --> 30:24.074
He doesn't care about anyone else.

530
30:25.140 --> 30:26.509
Zhao Sheng Ge.

531
30:28.268 --> 30:30.689
You are his only tether,

532
30:31.907 --> 30:34.587
and his last shred of sanity.

533
30:34.587 --> 30:37.474
He has suffered so much along the way.

534
30:38.988 --> 30:41.003
He often told me...

535
30:41.948 --> 30:44.081
that he wanted to buy a boat,

536
30:45.827 --> 30:48.708
so he could leave Hai City,

537
30:49.708 --> 30:51.959
and leave that home.

538
30:55.508 --> 30:58.537
For him to finally stand before you...

539
30:59.668 --> 31:02.169
it really wasn't easy.

540
31:13.668 --> 31:15.018
Han Jin.

541
31:15.921 --> 31:17.538
This is Zhao Sheng Ge.

542
31:19.068 --> 31:21.472
Stop the equity transfer.

543
31:27.908 --> 31:29.188
Lukas.

544
31:29.188 --> 31:31.628
Handle the CSRC penalty.

545
31:31.628 --> 31:33.428
Draft a response plan.

546
31:33.428 --> 31:34.708
Stall for a day.

547
31:34.708 --> 31:36.668
Check Song Qing Miao's recent accounts.

548
31:36.668 --> 31:40.388
Also, let Fang Jian make his own decision.

549
31:40.388 --> 31:42.228
I'm busy today.

550
31:45.948 --> 31:47.514
Xuan.

551
31:48.628 --> 31:50.587
Thank you.

552
31:50.587 --> 31:51.827
I'm going out.

553
31:51.827 --> 31:53.747
Make yourself at home.

554
31:59.444 --> 32:03.023
Chen Wan's suffering... is over.
